        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>应届生身份常见问题解答</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #1a1a1a;\n            padding: 20px;\n            max-width: 600px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #fff;\n        }\n        .title-container {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n        .title {\n            font-size: 26px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-bottom: 4px solid #F59A23;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        .red-oval {\n            border: 3px solid #D9001B;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n        .qa-item {\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        .q-row {\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        .q-num {\n            background-color: #8CC6DF;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            padding: 0 4px;\n            margin-right: 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            min-width: 12px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .q-text {\n            background-color: #E6EFD9;\n            padding: 2px 4px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #333;\n            display: inline-block;\n            box-shadow: -2px 0 0 #E6EFD9, 2px 0 0 #E6EFD9;\n        }\n        .orange-box {\n            border: 2px solid #F59A23;\n            padding: 0 2px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            margin: -2px 0;\n        }\n        .orange-wavy {\n            text-decoration: underline wavy #F59A23;\n            text-underline-offset: 3px;\n        }\n        .a-row {\n            color: #222;\n            font-size: 15px;\n        }\n        .purple-wavy {\n            text-decoration: underline wavy #B266FF;\n            text-underline-offset: 4px;\n        }\n        .grey-wavy {\n            text-decoration: underline wavy #999;\n            text-underline-offset: 4px;\n        }\n        .purple-line {\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #B266FF;\n            padding-bottom: 2px;\n        }\n        .star {\n            color: #B266FF;\n            font-size: 22px;\n            vertical-align: middle;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n        }\n        .purple-anno {\n            color: #B266FF;\n            font-size: 0.85em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"title-container\">\n        <div class=\"title\">\n            <span class=\"red-oval\">应届生</span>身份常见问题解答\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">1</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\">在读期间交了<span class=\"orange-box\">社保</span>算应届生吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row purple-wavy\">\n            算。在读期间实习交的社保不影响毕业应届生身份认定<span class=\"star\">☆</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">2</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\">寒暑假期间实习，公司交了<span class=\"orange-box\">社保</span>算应届生吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row\">\n            算。属于在读期间（非毕业找工作期间）缴纳的都不影响应届生身份认定。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">3</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\"><span class=\"orange-wavy\">兼职时交了</span><span class=\"orange-box\">工伤保险</span>影响应届生身份吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row\">\n            不影响。还是有应届生身份的。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">4</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\">毕业签了三方还是应届生吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row grey-wavy\">\n            算。毕业后没有缴纳社保，处于择业期内算应届毕业生\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">5</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\">应届生身份什么时候失效？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row\">\n            <span class=\"purple-line\">一是毕业以后缴纳了社保，</span><sub class=\"purple-anno\">①</sub> <span class=\"purple-line\">二是超过两年择业期。</span><sup class=\"purple-anno\">②</sup>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">6</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\">虽然毕业了<span class=\"orange-wavy\">但是公司没有交</span><span class=\"orange-box\">社保</span>算吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row\">\n            处于两年择业期的话，是算的。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n        <div class=\"q-row\">\n            <span class=\"q-num\">7</span>\n            <div class=\"q-text\">在找工作 签了<span class=\"orange-box\">三方协议</span>和<span class=\"orange-box\">劳动合同</span>还算应届生吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"a-row purple-wavy\">\n            不算。三方协议不算正式的劳动合同，但签定了正式的劳动合同就不算应届毕业生了。<span class=\"star\">☆</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
